WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — eco-synthesis (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:07.853
<v Narrator>Àwọn àkọlé àwòrán Ṣẹ̀dá àtílẹ̀-àṣírí nípa ìṣàfarawe-ìrọ̀ tí a tí ìyànṣé lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́.

2
00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:17.526
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ohun elo ti o ni agbara giga, a le lo awọn ẹrọ ibaraẹnisọrọ ati awọn ẹrọ itanna lati ṣe idanwo awọn iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti ara ẹni.

3
00:00:17.606 --> 00:00:25.190
<v Narrator>Oju opo wẹẹbu yii ni a ṣe lati jẹ ki awọn olumulo le wa ati wọle si alaye ti o wulo nipa lilo ẹrọ wiwa.
